 use of off-label agents (e.g., hydroxychloroquine, remdesivir, dexamethasone) and biologic and oral anti-cytokine agents (e.g., current treatment with adalimumab, infliximab, etanercept, golimumab, certolizumab pegol, tocilizumab, sarilumab, anakinra, canakinumab, rilonacept, baricitinib, tofacitinib, or upadacitinib); 

