 Participation in any clinical trial and/or use of any investigational product within the immediate 30-day period prior to the Screening/Baseline//Day 1 Visit; or receipt prior to Screening/Baseline/Day 1 Visit or intending to receive during the trial a COVID-19 vaccination.

